hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19250","Hajjaj narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us from Amr ibn Dinar from Amr ibn Aws from a man narrated by the muezzin of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) who said: The crier of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) called on a rainy day: Pray in the dwellings."
